  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved capacity of the government and social partners to plan and manage social protection</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ILO will support the implementation of the actuarial valuation of the pension funds. In doing so, information technology and information management systems will be critically assessed to achieve a social protection floor.  
Other non-contributory social protection measures will also be provided to better capacitate the involved stakeholders in their targeting strategies to reach the most vulnerable segments of society. ILO will asl introduce TRANSFORM ; a United Nations joint initiative that relies on innovative training that strengthens individual and institutional capacity for the management of national social protection systems.</narrative>
  </description>
